{"4797420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Urban assault", "steam_appid": 4797420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Urban Assault</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based multiplayer shooting in stylized urban arenas. Whether you're sniping from a rooftop, pushing the objective with a shotgun, or planting a flag in the enemy base, every fight comes down to your aim and your timing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-for-Al; — Last one standing in fast 10-player skirmishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Deathmatch— Two squads. One scoreboard. Coordinate or die.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Arsenal</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assault Rifles, SMGs, Shotguns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sniper Rifles with scope-in for long-range kills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistols for backup</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocket Launchers and Grenade Launchers for area control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frag and Smoke Grenades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Urban Assault</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based multiplayer shooting in stylized urban arenas. Whether you're sniping from a rooftop, pushing the objective with a shotgun, or planting a flag in the enemy base, every fight comes down to your aim and your timing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-for-Al; — Last one standing in fast 10-player skirmishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Deathmatch— Two squads. One scoreboard. Coordinate or die.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Arsenal</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assault Rifles, SMGs, Shotguns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S